BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[DEMERGER] TATAMOTORS - NCLT Scheme Ex-Date (T+1 Cutoff)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260923
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260924
UID:restr-TATAMOTORS-2026-09-23
DESCRIPTION:NCLT DEMERGER SCHEME OF ARRANGEMENT\n-------------------------
 ----------------\n• Demerged Entities: Commercial Vehicles (CV) operatio
 ns split from Passenger Vehicles (PV/EV).\n• Entitlement Ratio: 1 fully 
 paid equity share of New CV entity for every 1 share held in Tata Motors.
 \n• Special Call Auction: Exchanges conduct a special price discovery pr
 e-open session (09:00-10:00 AM IST).\n• Must purchase on or before today
  to be an eligible shareholder on Record Date.\n\n• Entitlement Ratio: 1
 :1 Share Allotment (CV & PV Entities)\n-----------------------------------
 ------\n• Open in TradingView App (Native):\n  tradingview://chart?symbo
 l=NSE:TATAMOTORS\n\n• Screener Corporate Profile:\n  https://www.screene
 r.in/company/TATAMOTORS/consolidated/\n\n• Official Exchange Disclosure 
 (PDF):\n  https://www.nseindia.com/get-quotes/equity?symbol=TATAMOTORS\n
LOCATION:NSE / BSE India
URL:https://in.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=NSE:TATAMOTORS
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Restructuring Cutoff Today: TATAMOTORS
TRIGGER:PT9H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
